changeSet.comment:
Ticket: LF-0054. Snapshot communication recipients at publish time and store selected trainer/staff targets.
Index review: UX_CommunicationRecipients_CommunicationId_UserId prevents duplicate delivery;
IX_CommunicationRecipients_TenantId_UserId_ReadAt serves the inbox and unread count;
UX_CommunicationAudienceTargets_CommunicationId_Kind_EntityId prevents duplicate selections.
Performance note: inbox and unread queries lead with TenantId and UserId.

rollback.sql:
DELETE FROM app.RolePermissions
WHERE PermissionId = (SELECT Id FROM app.Permissions WHERE Code = N'COMMUNICATION_READ')
  AND RoleId = (SELECT Id FROM app.Roles WHERE Name = N'Trainer');
DROP TABLE app.CommunicationRecipients;
DROP TABLE app.CommunicationAudienceTargets;
ALTER TABLE app.Communications DROP CONSTRAINT CK_Communications_AudienceType;
ALTER TABLE app.Communications ADD CONSTRAINT CK_Communications_AudienceType CHECK (AudienceType IN (N'AllMembers', N'ActiveMembers', N'ExpiringMembers', N'MembershipPackage', N'TrainerMembers', N'SelectedMembers'));
